<?php //a:9:{s:4:"file";s:6:"jmht1x";s:4:"path";s:10:"aboutqscms";s:5:"state";s:7:"publish";s:5:"title";s:22:"What is QScms(QsisCMS)";s:4:"tags";a:1:{i:0;s:23:"about，qscms，qsiscms";}s:4:"date";s:10:"2026-11-06";s:4:"time";s:8:"00:55:26";s:11:"can_comment";s:1:"1";s:7:"content";s:7354:"<h2>What is Qsis?</h2><p>Qsis is short for QuickSpeed info System, and has a homophonic nickname. Official Website: <a href="https://cms.qsis.cn" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">https://cms.qsis.cn</a> Core purpose: Host all manuscripts of the Shenwu Notes cognition system, and record the full development log of QsisCMS. Domain meaning: <a href="https://qsis.cn" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">qsis.cn</a> can be interpreted as "Rising Momentum China", or "Qiao Shuo is Chinese". Domain change notice: <a href="https://qed.cn" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">qed.cn</a> has stopped resolving to this site since February 2021 and is used for other purposes. Its domain resolution authority has been handed over to Mr. Huo.</p><h2>What are QsisCMS (QsCms) and QsisW?</h2><p>QsisW stands for Qsis Write, the original name of QsisCMS (QsCms). It refers to a content management system built for writing, also known as the QuickSpeed Info Writing System. The project was officially named Qsis CMS in 2018. During development and iteration, multiple branch versions are released by feature: QsisW, Qsis.G, QsisWB, etc. Demo Site: <a href="https://swbj.qsis.cn" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">swbj.qsis.cn</a> is the official demo site.</p><h2>Core Features</h2><ol><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>The kernel abandons Bootstrap and other heavy frameworks for clean, streamlined code;</li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Deeply optimized for mobile writing and publishing. Theme switching, preview and style adjustment are intuitive;</li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>The former dual-stack IPv4/IPv6 deployment solution is deprecated. It no longer supports multi-line sites without Nginx or Apache. This site uses port 88 for IPv4, and the domain resolves to IPv6 by default;</li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Built-in plugin system. You can develop custom plugins with plugin mount detection;</li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Two rich-text editors are included: xhEditor and Quill. xhEditor is further optimized to support embedded audio and video playback;</li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Draft auto-saves locally in real time. Content is protected against power loss, browser crash, accidental tab closure or device shutdown;</li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Unified backend management for site comments, with good compatibility across browsers and devices;</li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Configurable email service to send automatic notifications when new comments arrive;</li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Multiple eye-friendly reading modes:</li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>immersive reading, dark mode, inverted color mode, one-click toggle;</li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Native self-developed PHP program, no third-party front-end framework dependency. Full source code is open for review, enabling fast vulnerability fixes with transparent security;</li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span> Custom site navigation menu for flexible site building. Content can be edited and published without backend console or FTP;</li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Simple installation for rapid deployment;</li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span> Supports full-site SSG static page generation;</li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>One data source can generate and deploy two separate websites synchronously;</li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Built-in multi-language switch, supporting 31 languages worldwide;</li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Static sites support one-click sync to GitHub Pages;</li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Keyword filtering function to block sensitive words entered by administrators and users during writing; Full-site log recording and analysis;</li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Supports sub-site deployment;</li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>AI-assisted writing for articles;</li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Multiple AI text-to-speech voices available;</li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Multi-user system with complete user and group permission control, custom user groups supported;</li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Local backup &amp; packaging, with backup packages deliverable to a specified mailbox;</li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Remote config backup via your <a href="https://cms.qsis.cn" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">cms.qsis.cn</a> account. The Pro edition adds one-click full backup for articles and pages;</li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Online language pack editor and online theme editor;</li><li data-list="ordered"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Multiple secure login methods.</li></ol><h2>Design Philosophy</h2><p>Qsis adheres to a minimalist and clean program architecture. It avoids excessive external scripts and encrypted closed-source frameworks, and the whole system is built with lightweight open-source scripts. The source code is fully unencrypted. It ensures stable operation and better security, while keeping the code as open and transparent as possible.</p><h2>Release Editions</h2><p>QScms has two editions: Plain Text Edition and MySQL Edition. Technical support is available for both. The MySQL Edition is the Pro version, which requires more time and effort for maintenance.</p><h2>Free &amp; Licensing</h2><p>The two editions have independent licenses. The Plain Text Edition is completely free for commercial use. However, the copyright notice inside the source code must not be altered, and it comes with an official backup feature for configuration files. The MySQL Edition uses a one-time license. The price is 100 CNY / 15 USD, with no extra recurring fees. Direct commercial license users may choose an annual subscription. For annual pricing details, please contact <a href="mailto:qiaoshuo@gmail.com" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">qiaoshuo@gmail.com</a> (including future product upgrades and risk analysis services). For non-directly licensed users, I will not provide support. All support shall be provided by the party who deployed the system for you, and is unrelated to me and this platform. If you encounter issues during use, please visit <a href="https://community.qsis.cn/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">https://community.qsis.cn/</a> for discussion and help.</p>";}?>